36873217", "personaname": "精神状态堪忧", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198336873217/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 234883, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1117, "playtime_at_review": 105172, "last_played": 1787842551, "avatar": "702e677219a95dd11a13e5299e77c64339e596ae"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "挖矿这游戏实在太好玩了，我从来没遇见过这么好玩的游戏，游戏本体非常吸引人，平民的价格，优惠的dlc，不是那种传统的氪金游戏，越打越强，难度也很简单，画面精美，特效杠杠的，声音也是夺过冠军的旋律，优化很强，00年的电脑也能30帧稳定运行，不愧是夺过游戏奖杯的游戏，更新也很快，内容也超丰富，游玩方式各种各种，绝不无聊，bug也少有，一发现反馈给官方必定24小时内给你回复，48小时内必定修复，官方团队实在是太强了，论坛里官方也经常回复玩家们的消息，非常亲民，这游戏太棒了，此生无悔入挖矿！临近结尾有个小问题需要反馈一下需要修修，就是能进游戏就更好了", "timestamp_created": 1631713189, "timestamp_updated": 1656324277, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505208373069763184", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99391771", "author": {"steamid": "76561199031228876", "personaname": "一身转战三千里", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199031228876/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 71787, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 43344, "last_played": 1667543844, "avatar": "79a8119bd2a027755f93872d0d09b959909a0405"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "你这搞的什么更新，玩的好好的，突然整这么一出，还玩NMD，SBLZ", "timestamp_created": 1631711342, "timestamp_updated": 1631711342, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.578219830989837646", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99388247", "author": {"steamid": "76561198323323875", "personaname": "小龙小龙几点钟